# Environment variables — names only, never values.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in, or leave this alone and use `.env.op`,
# which holds 1Password references instead of secrets and is what
# `npm run gen:media` actually reads. Prefer `.env.op`: no key lands on disk.
#
# `.gitignore` ignores `.env*` and then re-admits this file and `.env.op`, so
# a real secret cannot be committed by accident.

# Vercel AI Gateway. Reaches both image and video models on one credential.
# Only the asset pipeline needs it — `npm run dev` and `npm run build` do not.
# Video generation additionally requires a $10 minimum gateway balance; below
# that the gateway answers 402 and only stills are produced.
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
